1. Clone the repository
2. Install Go 1.26.10 or a later supported security release
3. Install binaries to $GOPATH/bin

    go install -tags "oss nolimit" github.com/drone/drone/cmd/drone-server

4. Start the server at localhost:8080

    export DRONE_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=...
    export DRONE_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=...
    drone-server

CI must use the Go builder pinned in .drone.yml for tests and builds.
The upstream harnessharness_drone_image Harness pipeline is configured
outside this repository. Update its Go run-step images separately;
changing .drone.yml does not update it. Older images fail with
GOTOOLCHAIN=local and must not build a security release.
